==English==

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Not [[symmetrical]].
# {{context|of a question|lang=en}} Presenting a [[false dilemma]], or a choice between two things which are not opposites.
#: ''Question six is asymmetrical: "Are things going in the right direction or on the wrong track?"'' (The West Wing, Season 1, Episode 21, Toby)

